WEBVTT

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:51.100
What a cozy little house!

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.850
I'll be safe here for sure!

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:59.810
I finally found my home, sweet home!

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.770
Oh, there you are, Letty.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.980
Welcome home!

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:14.860
"A Home with Falls"

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.230
My, you're finally awake.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:25.230
Wait, uh... Who are you?

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.440
My apologies. My name is--

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:37.690
Are you quite all right?

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:41.350
Oh! Yep, I'm fine!

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:44.270
Thank you for rescuing me.

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.350
My name is Letty.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:51.230
I was told there was a
"capable elf architect" in this area.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:55.850
And that is why you are here?
What a coincidence.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:01.230
I am the elf for whom you search.

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:04.480
I am Dearia the Architect.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:18.340
Loading...

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:17.060
Hello? Are you still with me?

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.230
Oh, dear.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.720
Load complete

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.020
Please find me a home!

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.310
It would be my pleasure.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.810
Though you do have a plethora of options.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:28.270
Would you like to build your own home,
purchase an existing home,

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.600
or rent from a property owner?

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.600
O-Oh, right, I have options!

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:36.900
I am both a registered architect
and a licensed real estate agent,

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.280
so come at me, bro.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.400
He's so cool!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.770
Here's my card.

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:43.020
Oh, thank you.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.600
Oh, I see here you're a...

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:45.830
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:45.870
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:45.910
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:45.950
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:45.990
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:46.030
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:46.080
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:46.370
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:46.450
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:46.490
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:46.530
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:46.870
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.160
{=0}Demon Lord

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.770
...Demon Lord?

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.400
Yes, that is one of
my occupations as well.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.230
Wow... Is he the Demon Lord
of real estate?!

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:59.190
That's so cool! You're awesome!

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:00.560
Let us get started, then.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:04.150
Might I ask what kind of home
you're interested in?

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:07.730
Of course! So, uh...

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.350
I want a cozy little cottage!

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:13.310
I'm not sure a cozy cottage could
accommodate someone of your size.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.980
I fully intend to respect your wishes,

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:22.440
but a simple design like this
would be rather lax on security.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:25.950
{=2}Cozy

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:25.950
{=1}Little

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:25.950
{=3}Dragons? Nope

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.940
If a Hero party stumbled upon your home,
you would be as good as dead.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:27.650
Heroes again...

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.270
You mean there're <i>more</i>
of those meanies out there?

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:33.440
Yes, many more. Plenty of them are,
dare I say it, the epitome of cringe.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.350
I kinda feel bad for humanity.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:39.440
Whereas hunters are specialized
in hunting down non-humans...

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.170
Quest complete!

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.650
...Heroes are bloodthirsty
killing machines.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:48.940
They rob, murder, and pillage,
and even assist with political coups.

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:52.480
There isn't enough time in the day
to detail every last one of their crimes.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:56.600
I'm sure going into those details
would be of no help to you,

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.900
so let us start with a tour.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.980
A tour of where?

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:05.400
A dwelling the Heroes call a "dungeon."

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.730
One you may be able to call home.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.370
"Today, you are a beautiful fountain!"

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.230
What kind of spell is that?!

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.900
Whoa, it's huge!

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.440
Is this all one temple?

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:34.850
This is a 27-year-old structure
built to resemble ancient temples.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.810
Wait, back up. How did we get here?!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.150
A basic teleportation spell.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.730
This property was built
for powerful inhabitants

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:46.850
and possesses a number
of anti-Hero countermeasures.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:51.560
The owner recently approached me
about selling the property.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:55.520
If you find it to your liking,
I recommend placing an offer today.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:58.940
This seems kinda big for me...

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.480
Dragons like you do require
larger accommodations.

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:18.270
Th-This is a lot of space
for just one person.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.690
Do watch your step.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.690
If you happen to activate a trap...

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.030
WAAAUGH

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.560
...you'll find yourself falling.

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:29.480
Oh, dear, I should have
mentioned that earlier.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.990
B1F

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:34.020
Mister Dearia, what is
<i>wrong</i> with this place?!

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:36.310
Nothing. It is a subterranean dungeon
equipped with anti-Hero traps.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:51.430
You Are Here

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.730
This residence consists of four floors,

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:41.230
one aboveground and the rest underground.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.730
In order to protect the
first-floor living quarters,

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:46.770
the rest of the structure
is built like an antlion pit,

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:49.270
dropping would-be intruders
deeper into the basement levels.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:55.020
I'm pleased to say that most Heroes
who enter this structure do not exit it.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:58.400
Since we're here, why don't we go ahead
and explore the dungeon a bit?

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.560
Can we not?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.310
Have no fear. Resurrection spells
happen to be one of my specialties.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.770
I'd rather not have to be
resurrected in the first place!

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.100
First, let us open this door.

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:13.520
By placing the correct shape
in the depression...

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.900
Yeah, yeah, this is pretty easy!

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:16.850
...you'll fall into a trap.

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.520
Why?!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.660
WHY

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.960
B2F

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.770
You're wonderfully obedient, Letty.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:30.980
Thanks.

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.520
What's the deal with this one?

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.060
These are braziers.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:41.600
By lighting them in the correct order,
a drawbridge will descend.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:44.060
I know he's just trying to get me
to fall into another trap!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.560
Well, I'm not gonna be "obedient"
for him this time! I'm not <i>that</i> dumb!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:53.350
Why didn't you light them in order?

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.560
You big meanie!

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:58.190
Let's take a look at
the third basement floor.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:00.150
Hey, Mister Dearia?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:24.650
B3F

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:25.020
We've steadily descended, haven't we?

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.190
Though that descent was
mostly rapid and unexpected.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:31.900
Uh, Dearia? Can we pause for a sec?

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.270
Of course. Let's have ourselves
a little break, then.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:36.900
As it so happens, there is
a healing spring right over here.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:37.900
Whoa!

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:47.810
Wait, couldn't Heroes use this
to heal themselves?

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.190
Not to worry.

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:51.850
It's equipped with sensors that detect
intruders and flush them away.

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:53.060
Wait, what?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.600
I'm gonna drown!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.480
How was your experience?

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:16.650
Now I know how dead goldfish feel.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.770
Where would I have ended up, anyway?!

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:22.060
There are some things
you're better off not knowing.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:23.690
Eep!

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:26.770
That concludes my demonstration
of this structure's anti-Hero traps.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.230
Now we move on to the obstacle course
that leads back to the first floor.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:30.520
Do give it your all.

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:32.730
What is this, a training arc?!

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.900
I guess I don't want to go
back the way we came, though...

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.560
Fine! I'll do it!

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:41.190
Up I go!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:42.230
My word, Letty!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.810
Yes?

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:47.810
I suppose flying up there
would be quite uncouth, wouldn't it?

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.900
Uncouth. That's totally it.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:53.770
Don't look down, don't look down...

00:09:53.770 --> 00:10:01.230
Don't look down, I'm not looking down...

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:04.350
How the hell do we get out of here?!

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:06.600
Whoa, look at that!

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.020
It's a dragon! And it's climbing the wall!

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:11.810
Rare mats ahoy!

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.400
Don't let it get away!

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.310
You don't gotta tell me twice!

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.650
Stop right there.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:22.230
You will not get in his way.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.560
Who the hell are <i>you</i> ?!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.350
What's an elf doing down here?!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.940
Who cares! Attack!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:33.480
I got 'im!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.770
I believe I told you...

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:45.310
...not to get in his way.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.230
Don't look down, don't look down...

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:57.650
Not looking down, no, not looking down...

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:06.350
I finally made it.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.900
Remarkable effort, Letty.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:10.440
Dearia!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.770
Letty.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.650
You've done very well.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:23.650
Oh, Dearia!

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:25.150
Would you like to make
an offer on this property?

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.350
No, thank you.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:31.770
I don't think I could live
in a house full of pitfalls and traps.

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:36.980
After that tour, Letty's muscles
were sore for days.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:02.770
Owie, owie...

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.770
Are you quite all right, Letty?

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:09.060
Yeah. My muscles are
feeling a lot less sore.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:12.060
But I really don't want
to fall in any more traps.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:18.350
Not to worry. Our next property
has no traps installed whatsoever.

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:21.060
What's this one like?

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:24.350
How do I put this...

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:27.020
Heroes will never go near it.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.440
It's the perfect bachelor pad.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:32.690
If you choose to live there,
you'll never feel lonely.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:36.100
Wow! That sounds great!

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:41.270
It was built over 200 years ago,
but it still has a lot of life left in it.

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.400
Though it will require a few renovations.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.100
That's totally fine! Let's go!

00:12:56.270 --> 00:13:00.190
This place looks kinda
haunted, doesn't it?

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.400
Oh, it <i>is</i> haunted.

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:02.900
Okay, next house.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:05.520
Now, now.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:08.350
Before you make a hasty judgment,
you should take a quick tour.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.270
I don't wanna!

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:38.310
This place really fits the bill
for "haunted mansion"...

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.810
Think of it as a promising fixer-upper.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.020
Wait for me!

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:48.350
I-Is this place really haunted?

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:49.190
Yes, absolutely.

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:51.730
Why do you keep emphasizing that?!

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:55.850
Sellers must provide prospective buyers
with all pertinent disclosures.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.730
D-Disclosures?

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:01.310
If there are defects in the
property to be purchased,

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.100
the seller must disclose
those defects to the buyer.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:06.850
So basically, you <i>have</i>
to tell them if it's haunted.

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:08.770
Correct. That, and...

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.060
And what?

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:12.650
Death is just a part of living.
Here, I mean.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:13.730
Thanks for the reminder!

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:16.020
Exorcism won't get rid of them, either.

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:22.190
Now, they say a picture
paints a thousand words,

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:24.020
so we're going to spend
the night here tonight.

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:25.190
What?!

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.690
I've had a bed prepared for you, Letty.

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:29.270
You went all-out!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:31.400
Oh, before I forget.

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:34.150
If you run into trouble, please
make use of this vacuum cleaner.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.230
Wait, what do you mean, run into trouble?

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.020
Press R to activate the Strobulb.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:39.940
Uh, Dearia?

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.310
You'll also need this
ink ribbon and typewriter.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:45.310
How am I supposed to use those?

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.350
Just look it up.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:51.940
You're really freaking me out, here!

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.190
No matches...

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:59.150
I wish I had a lamp...

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:02.600
I'll be staying in the next room over, Letty.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.980
What?! No, c-come back!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.980
Sweet dreams.

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:11.560
H-How am I supposed to have
sweet dreams in this creepy place?!

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:13.520
Dearia!

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:20.270
Forgive me, I forgot to give
you these healing items.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.310
You could've just knocked!

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.440
It's so dark and scary.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:32.940
C'mon, sun! Hurry up and rise already!

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:37.100
Wh-What?

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:40.310
Th-That scared the heck outta me!
Guess it was just a picture falling.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:47.650
Nope, someone's there!

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:51.480
Dearia!

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.850
Huh?

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.150
Where's the door?

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.940
Where <i>is</i> the next room over?

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.270
Dearia!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.060
O-Oh, no, is something following me?

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.230
I-I saw a ghost!

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:26.440
Wait, what?! The camera
switched to first-person view?!

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.600
Now it's even scarier!

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.310
And it's pitch-black in here!

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:31.480
How am I supposed to see?!

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:32.600
Excuse me.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:33.850
Yes?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:34.770
Please, take this.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.350
Oh, thank you.

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.560
Thank goodness. Now I've got a light to--

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:42.560
Wait, who gave it to me?!

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.690
Don't worry about it,
don't worry about it...

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.230
No thoughts, head empty.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.100
I just gotta find Dearia...

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:50.770
Gosh, is it dark...

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:59.100
Someone definitely died here!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:02.270
Going this way is gonna be a bad idea!

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.980
I wish I could turn back, but...

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:07.730
There's more of them!

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:09.770
I've gotta go through here!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.650
Huh?

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:27.230
Letty? Letty?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.060
Please wake up.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.190
Wakey wakey.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.810
Dearia?

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:39.060
And he's out again.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:43.560
Perhaps this was a bit much for him.

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.940
Now, now, this is how we
like to welcome our visitors.

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:52.900
I hardly imagined dragons
could be so delicate.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.850
You were welcoming me?

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:58.440
Good morning, dear Letty.

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:02.900
Forgive the late introduction.
This is the property owner, Lord Samuel.

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:06.230
He reigned over these
lands 200 years ago.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.810
When I told him you'd like to tour,

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.560
he went all-out to arrange
this welcome party for you.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.520
These wraiths and ghouls
are his loyal retainers.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:16.900
They decided to put together a little
spooky experience for you to enjoy.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.150
A <i>little</i> ?!

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:22.440
Whatever is the matter, Letty?
This is prime real estate.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:27.020
So, uh, what makes it so "prime," then?

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:29.190
First and foremost,
Heroes will not bother you here.

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:33.150
The items found in this mansion
are of no value to them at all.

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:38.730
Coins too old to be used for trade,
expired potions, broken swords.

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:41.400
Wraiths and ghouls don't
drop valuable materials, either.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.980
No Hero would waste their time
exploring and looting this place.

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.650
Oh.

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:51.980
That, and with the ghosts keeping
a constant watch on the property,

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.560
you never need to worry about
security, and you'll never be lonely.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.350
Thanks, but no thanks.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:02.310
Then I shall rally my retainers and leave,
if that would ease your worries.

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:03.650
Oh, no, I couldn't--

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.100
It's quite all right.

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:08.060
We'll retreat to our graves
in the backyard.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.150
If you need anything, just holler!

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:11.940
Why wasn't <i>this</i> defect disclosed?!

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:13.560
The property has a special
going on right now.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:14.850
Huh? What kind of special?

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:19.350
If you purchase today, all of the ghouls
squatting on the property will stay.

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:20.810
We've got your back!

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:22.400
No, thank you!

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:27.600
What's happening?! Stop! Put me down!

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:27.310
What a nostalgic sight.

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:30.060
Hip hip hooray! Hip hip hooray!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.520
I would agree.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:37.940
Back when blood still flowed through
my veins, when we first met,

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:41.350
I believe you were traveling
with another dragon.

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:45.690
That is correct.

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:51.100
Perhaps that is why I have
a soft spot for dragons in particular.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:54.310
A Demon Lord with a soft spot!

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:58.020
D-Dearia... Please help.

00:19:58.020 --> 00:19:59.440
My, my.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.150
One moment, please.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:07.230
Hey, Dearia?

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:08.100
Yes?

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:12.150
I-I think I need a home
where I can relax a little easier.

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:15.350
That's not gonna happen if
I'm surrounded by dead people...

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.190
Aww.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.730
Understandable.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:20.350
I'll ensure our next property is somewhere
the dead wouldn't dare haunt.

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:23.190
Maybe ensure it's somewhere
the <i>living</i> would want to haunt.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:33.940
Y-You have a lovely home,
but I'm afraid it's not for me.

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:40.600
That's quite all right. Everyone must
find the home that is right for them.

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.060
Goodbye, then.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.400
Sir Dragon!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:57.150
Safe travels to you!

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:02.480
Thank you!

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:12.440
Lord Samuel looked scary,
but he's a nice guy on the inside!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:14.230
He's so cool!

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:15.980
I would agree.

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:20.600
He was betrayed by a close friend
and driven off his lands.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:25.190
He and his hundred retainers then
committed suicide and turned into wraiths,

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:28.900
who descended upon the land and
slaughtered every being living upon it.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.730
What an incredible man.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.770
In the end, Letty decided
wraiths were scary.

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:44.690
I'm too scared to get up and pee!

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:16.490
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:16.480 --> 00:23:19.350
You're concerned about ghosts
haunting your rental property?

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:16.540
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:16.580
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:22.350
If the previous resident met
with an unfortunate demise,

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:24.770
then the unit becomes
a "stigmatized property,"

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:29.730
and real estate agents must disclose
this information to potential buyers.

00:23:29.730 --> 00:23:32.350
If I'd known, I wouldn't
have signed the contract!

00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:34.440
This is known as a "duty to disclose."

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:34.550
Duty to Disclose

00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:38.190
Interestingly, in countries
where old housing is abundant,

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:40.850
prospective buyers do not care about
the previous owner's manner of death,

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:45.190
even preferring properties
that are, indeed, haunted.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:47.350
Next time, "My First Home."

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:47.610
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:47.650
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:48.400
Elf Housing Realty
